<title>JAPAN: Shinko Pantec -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinko Pantec -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.24		vs	   18.73</p>
<p> Operating   loss 259    million	  vs     prft 1.06</p>
<p> Current	     64    million	  vs	    1.36</p>
<p> Net		  366    million	  vs	  522    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.73 yen	  vs	   20.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     25 million	  vs	  25 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinko Pantec Co Ltd is a plant maker affiliated with Kobe Steel.</p>
</text>
